rets how his time with CLG ended  [Music]  but it's hard not to wonder how long's  career would have turned out in the  current na LCS environment an  environment that has a lot more  structure and support for its players  nowadays link still streams sometimes  playing league of legends  sometimes like fortnight  but he's back on track to what he was  doing before his eSports career studying  at Berkeley blink has largely moved on  from eSports but his dunzo manifesto  will stand as a historical document from  an NA LCS that is hopefully long since  passed thanks for watching if you want  more great content just like this be  sure to hit the subscribe button  [Music]

